    "mention": "Créé par @kuldeep541 sur TailwindFlex",
    "rawHtml": "<div class=\"bg-gray-100 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen space-y-4\">\n  <!-- Button 1: Gradient Button -->\n  <button class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg transform transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-xl\">\n    Gradient Button\n  </button>\n\n  <!-- Button 2: Outline with Hover Fill -->\n  <button class=\"border-2 border-blue-500 text-blue-500 font-semibold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-blue-500 hover:text-white\">\n    Outline Button\n  </button>\n\n  <!-- Button 3: Neon Glowing -->\n  <button class=\"bg-gray-900 text-green-400 font-semibold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border-2 border-green-400 transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-105\">\n    Neon Button\n  </button>\n\n  <!-- Button 4: Sliding Background -->\n  <button class=\"relative bg-white text-black font-semibold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group\">\n    <span class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-500 transform -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out\"></span>\n    <span class=\"relative z-10\">Sliding Background</span>\n  </button>\n\n  <!-- Button 5: Pulsing Animation -->\n  <button class=\"bg-pink-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg animate-pulse hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\">\n    Pulsing Button\n  </button>\n</div>"
